---
import InfoLayout from '../../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
import { en } from '../../i18n/en';
---
<InfoLayout t={en} locale="en" title="Copyright & privacy" eyebrow="About this guide" lead="This independent noncommercial tourism and cultural information guide is not the site manager or a ticket service. Nonprofit describes its purpose, not registered charitable status.">
  <div class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#526064]">
    <p>Google Analytics loads automatically to measure page use and may use cookies and connection data. Google Fonts and the embedded Google Maps also connect to Google. This page has no analytics consent control.</p>
    <p>Cloudflare provides hosting and security and may process connection and technical data. When hosting loads a Cloudflare Web Analytics browser beacon, it measures visits, page views and load performance and may process page paths, referring sites and browser or device information. It runs independently of Google Analytics; this page has no switch for it. <a class="underline" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/high-level-metrics/">Metric details</a> · <a class="underline" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/">Beacon data collection</a>.</p>
    <p>The photograph and resized versions load from this site. No device location is needed. Providers have separate data policies. <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google</a> · <a class="underline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare</a>.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[#657174]">Full Privacy Policy and Cookie Settings live on separate pages: <a class="underline" href="/en/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a class="underline" href="/en/cookie-settings/">Cookie Settings</a></p>
  </div>
</InfoLayout>
